{"title":"少年毛泽东","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1949,"month":6,"day":23}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"米谷"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"米谷作(三)因为穷苦，毛家还欠下不少的债，债主常到毛家来催逼，一家人向债主说尽好话，穷凶极恶的债主还不肯出门。"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}